{"3907840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Out Of Water", "steam_appid": 3907840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In <strong>Out of Water</strong>, you step into the daily life of Watarholt - a northern Germanic village preparing for winter - and experience its slow unraveling through your own choices. What begins as a calm, grounded look into village life soon shifts into mystery, grief, and danger as you become the one people turn to when things start to go wrong.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/extras/34c8fc0a68bb741593d80bba2f28f346.poster.avif?t=1788292117\" width=800 height=74 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/extras/34c8fc0a68bb741593d80bba2f28f346.webm?t=1788292117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The harvest is done. The lake runs still. But something in Watarholt is changing... and you feel it before anyone else does.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/extras/ec25ea494fe4b9bd80938e59442cf434.avif?t=1788292117\" width=330 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You explore this world through conversations, relationships, and the rhythms of village life. You decide how you speak to others, how you comfort them, how much you trust them - and how much they trust you. As the woods grow hostile and the waters turn deadly, you shape how the people around you respond to fear, tradition, and the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/extras/63407f3d68674d2c6721a7ba99539d22.avif?t=1788292117\" width=330 height=83 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Out of Water includes a free 45-page artbook!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the making of Watarholt with additional artwork, development material, lore, and commentary from the creation of Out of Water.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >45 pages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 exclusive illustrations not found in the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Development sketches and artwork</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional lore and developer commentary</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The artbook is included <strong>free with the game</strong> and can be found in the installation folder:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>...\\steamapps\\common\\Out Of Water</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The artbook contains major spoilers and is best enjoyed AFTER finishing the game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/extras/fdc5d3a074cb1adc341b0fc15d29cabe.avif?t=1788292117\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/extras/e59de0269035bdcca1a78c89c06628b4.poster.avif?t=1788292117\" width=1000 height=554 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/extras/e59de0269035bdcca1a78c89c06628b4.webm?t=1788292117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/extras/e59de0269035bdcca1a78c89c06628b4.mp4?t=1788292117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/extras/5fdca787a71d2c36a5d774ec4c79c0af.avif?t=1788292117\" width=152 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions shape the story. Choose your words carefully - not every outcome will turn out well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build trust, challenge beliefs, or push others away. Your relationships and reputation define your path through grief, faith, and fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/extras/d5cf9541aa3dd2a87021fdad6c359c5d.avif?t=1788292117\" width=152 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a world brought to life through hand-drawn characters and environments, subtly animated to capture the stillness and unease of a fading summer. Every expression, every silence tells part of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/extras/0d748ddeb0656f6291bec7d6c3e940b7.avif?t=1788292117\" width=152 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your name, demeanor, and worldview. Out of Water invites you to project yourself into its world - the protagonist is defined not by presets, but by your imagination and choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/extras/57ca9dcbeb80805503544b6da57a65d8.avif?t=1788292117\" width=152 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Romance is entirely optional. You may form deep bonds - as friends, allies, or lovers - with one of three men: Harik, Ansgar, or Basi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your path with each is shaped by trust, belief, and shared experience. Love changes the story, but it’s never required to complete it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/extras/2ce617d59f0f4ae5fad8c6c871f340ed.avif?t=1788292117\" width=330 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tale of Watarholt unfolds at your pace, through your choices, and in your voice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/extras/ec25ea494fe4b9bd80938e59442cf434.avif?t=1788292117\" width=330 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Out of Water</strong> features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ Backgrounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >23 characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >47 CGs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 relationship endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 relationship routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 main routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >80k+ words</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/extras/03dc320b046dd6d8f64b348ffb0596ef.avif?t=1788292117\" width=330 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/extras/3f80741b2d4f9d7197b0a9272527a5f2.avif?t=1788292117\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/extras_big/3f80741b2d4f9d7197b0a9272527a5f2.webp?t=1788292117 width=1560 height=1170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/extras/7b9603c630218d5edaaf3db11f016278.avif?t=1788292117\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/extras_big/7b9603c630218d5edaaf3db11f016278.webp?t=1788292117 width=1560 height=1170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/extras/49d87d99c08f36ad064a89e381ca7c17.avif?t=1788292117\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/extras_big/49d87d99c08f36ad064a89e381ca7c17.webp?t=1788292117 width=1560 height=1170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/extras/029f18f54d084b9d9832385a485110f0.avif?t=1788292117\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In <strong>Out of Water</strong>, you step into the daily life of Watarholt - a northern Germanic village preparing for winter - and experience its slow unraveling through your own choices. What begins as a calm, grounded look into village life soon shifts into mystery, grief, and danger as you become the one people turn to when things start to go wrong.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/extras/34c8fc0a68bb741593d80bba2f28f346.poster.avif?t=1788292117\" width=800 height=74 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/extras/34c8fc0a68bb741593d80bba2f28f346.webm?t=1788292117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The harvest is done. The lake runs still. But something in Watarholt is changing... and you feel it before anyone else does.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/extras/ec25ea494fe4b9bd80938e59442cf434.avif?t=1788292117\" width=330 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You explore this world through conversations, relationships, and the rhythms of village life. You decide how you speak to others, how you comfort them, how much you trust them - and how much they trust you. As the woods grow hostile and the waters turn deadly, you shape how the people around you respond to fear, tradition, and the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/extras/63407f3d68674d2c6721a7ba99539d22.avif?t=1788292117\" width=330 height=83 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Out of Water includes a free 45-page artbook!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the making of Watarholt with additional artwork, development material, lore, and commentary from the creation of Out of Water.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >45 pages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 exclusive illustrations not found in the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Development sketches and artwork</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional lore and developer commentary</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The artbook is included <strong>free with the game</strong> and can be found in the installation folder:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>...\\steamapps\\common\\Out Of Water</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The artbook contains major spoilers and is best enjoyed AFTER finishing the game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/extras/fdc5d3a074cb1adc341b0fc15d29cabe.avif?t=1788292117\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/extras/e59de0269035bdcca1a78c89c06628b4.poster.avif?t=1788292117\" width=1000 height=554 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/extras/e59de0269035bdcca1a78c89c06628b4.webm?t=1788292117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/extras/e59de0269035bdcca1a78c89c06628b4.mp4?t=1788292117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\