si.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your path with each is shaped by trust, belief, and shared experience. Love changes the story, but it’s never required to complete it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/extras/2ce617d59f0f4ae5fad8c6c871f340ed.avif?t=1788292117\" width=330 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tale of Watarholt unfolds at your pace, through your choices, and in your voice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/extras/ec25ea494fe4b9bd80938e59442cf434.avif?t=1788292117\" width=330 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Out of Water</strong> features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ Backgrounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >23 characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >47 CGs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 relationship endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 relationship routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 main routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >80k+ words</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/extras/03dc320b046dd6d8f64b348ffb0596ef.avif?t=1788292117\" width=330 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/extras/3f80741b2d4f9d7197b0a9272527a5f2.avif?t=17